#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
CodeEfficiencyAnalyzer v19.0 – More Java Vuln Patches, Added Go Autofix, Robust Fixes
Improvements:
- Expanded Java vuln patches: SQLi (replace Statement -> PreparedStatement), XSS (add OWASP Encoder), XXE (disable features), Deserialization (add whitelist), CSRF (add tokens stub), Logging (use SLF4J, avoid sensitive), RCE (replace Runtime.exec with ProcessBuilder + sanitize)
- Added Go autofix: gofmt -w for format, golangci-lint --fix for lints/smells/unused/vulns (assume installed), go vet for checks
- Made fixes robust: Error handling in transformers, backups, severity-based chaining, user-configurable via YAML (e.g., enable/disable patches)
- Refactored: More transformers (e.g., XXEPatcher, XSSPatcher), try-except per fix, log fixes
"""

